<title>USA: Bowling Green MPC, Ky. won by Ross Sinclaire.</title>
<headline>Bowling Green MPC, Ky. won by Ross Sinclaire.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ross Sinclaire said it won $1.56 million of Bowling Green Municipal Projects Corporation, Ky., lease revenue bonds, 1997 Series A, with a net interest cost of 4.728 percent.</p>
</text>
